    "Interleaved HUD icon caches2800..2803 remain presentation-owned. Cycle starts0CFA/0CFC and ends0CFC/0CFE share one existing resource word; impact limits remain resource views. No model writer is not a constness proof; foreign byte windows still preserve mutations",
